msgctxt "#301126"
msgid "Activates background video in the main menu."
msgstr "Aktiverer baggrundsvideo i hovedmenuen."

msgctxt "#301132"
msgid "Select the country for the age rating (defined in the scrapper).[CR]Supported are DE, US, UK, FR.[CR]If only US ratings are available, these are displayed."
msgstr "Vælg land for aldersklassificering (defineret i scrapper).[CR]Følgende lande understøttes: DE, US, UK, FR.[CR]Hvis kun amerikanske klassifikationer er tilgængelige, vises de."

msgctxt "#301134"
msgid "Trailer are directly displayed in the movie information or in fullscreen mode."
msgstr "Trailers vises direkte i filminformationen eller i fuld skærm."

msgctxt "#301135"
msgid "If a visualization is selected for music playback, it will also be displayed in the main menu."
msgstr "Hvis en visualisering er valgt til musikafspilning, vises den også i hovedmenuen."

msgctxt "#301136"
msgid "Displays playlist of the next 9 titles in main menu and in fullscreen mode."
msgstr "Viser en spilleliste med de næste 9 numre i hovedmenuen og på fuld skærm."

msgctxt "#301140"
msgid "Define the volume in percent, which will be played on any start of KODI.[CR]Quote a figure between 0 and 100."
msgstr "Indstil lydstyrken i procent, der skal afspilles, hver gang KODI startes.[CR]Angiv et tal fra 0 - 100."

msgctxt "#301142"
msgid "Disable alphanumeric jump list in SMS style.[CR][COLOR=grey]Imported from the skin \'Alaska\'[/COLOR]."
msgstr "Deaktiverer alfanumerisk springliste i SMS-stil.[CR][COLOR=grey]Importeret fra skin \'Alaska.\'[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301143"
msgid "To use this function you need the addon \'Skinhelper Ping\' by _Andy_/PvD.[CR][COLOR=white]It can be installed here under Addons or via the Kodinerds Repo[/COLOR]."
msgstr "For at bruge denne funktion kræves tilføjelsen \'Skinhelper Ping\' af _Andy_/PvD.[CR][COLOR=grey]Den kan installeres her under Tilføjelser eller via Kodinerds Repo.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301144"
msgid "Starts the selected playlist after starting KODI."
msgstr "Starter den valgte afspilningsliste efter start af KODI."

msgctxt "#301145"
msgid "To use this function, the addon \'Global Search\' from the official repository is required."
msgstr "For at bruge denne funktion kræves tilføjelsen \'Global Search\' fra det officielle arkiv."

msgctxt "#301146"
msgid "Shows a small statistic about the database entries in the lower right corner of the main menu."
msgstr "Viser en lille statistik over databaseposterne nederst til højre i hovedmenuen."

msgctxt "#301147"
msgid "Shows the favourites below the main menu instead of directly the \'Central\'. [CR]These are otherwise accessible via the \'Central\'."
msgstr "Viser favoritterne under hovedmenuen i stedet for direkte i \'Central\'.[CR]Disse kan ellers nås via \'Central\'."

msgctxt "#301148"
msgid "Hides the \'Central\' located below the main menu."
msgstr "Skjuler \'Central\', der er placeret under hovedmenuen."

msgctxt "#301150"
msgid "Activates an icon in the upper right corner that shows the battery's charge status.[CR][COLOR=white]An incorrect display occurs on computers without a battery.[/COLOR]"
msgstr "Aktiverer et ikon i øverste højre hjørne, der viser status for batteriets opladning.[CR][COLOR=white]Der sker forkert visning på computere uden batteri.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301151"
msgid "The settings for the widget are in the respective submenu of the main menus."
msgstr "Indstillingerne for widget'en findes i den respektive undermenu i hovedmenuen."

msgctxt "#301152"
msgid "Dims all unfocused covers."
msgstr "Dæmper alle ikke-fokuserede dækninger."

msgctxt "#301153"
msgid "Hides the green progress bar on the covers."
msgstr "Skjuler den grønne statuslinje på forsider."

msgctxt "#301166"
msgid "This skin contains various animation effects.[CR]With this switch you can deactivate them. Instead, a simple fade effect is used.[CR]This can lead to better performance on slow systems."
msgstr "Dette skin indeholder forskellige animationseffekter.[CR]Brug denne switch til at deaktivere dem. I stedet anvendes en simpel fadeeffekt.[CR]Dette kan resultere i en bedre ydeevne på langsomme systemer."

msgctxt "#301168"
msgid "Displays in the upper left corner, where you are."
msgstr "Viser, hvor du befinder dig i øverste venstre hjørne."

msgctxt "#301169"
msgid "Hides the date display in the upper right corner."
msgstr "Skjuler datovisningen i øverste højre hjørne."

msgctxt "#301170"
msgid "Activates fanart in all areas."
msgstr "Aktiverer fanart i alle områder."

msgctxt "#301171"
msgid "Disables changing background pictures.[CR]Select an own picture or path."
msgstr "Deaktiverer ændring af baggrundsbilleder.[CR][COLOR=white]Vælg dit eget billede eller sti.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301172"
msgid "Select a picture. If no pictures is chosen, a standard picture will be displayed.[CR][COLOR=white]Click again for deleting.[/COLOR]"
msgstr "Vælg et billede her.[CR]Hvis der ikke er angivet noget billede, vises et standardbillede.[CR][COLOR=white]Klik igen for at slette det.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301173"
msgid "Shows a slideshow in the background, based on the KODI library.[CR][COLOR=white]Visible in the main menu under: Movies, Series and Music.[/COLOR]"
msgstr "Viser et diasshow i baggrunden, baseret på KODI-biblioteket.[CR][COLOR=white]Synlig i hovedmenuen under: Film, serier og musik.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301174"
msgid "Enables the dimming of the background in all areas.[CR][COLOR=white]Possible dimming steps: OFF, LIGHT, MEDIUM, STRONG.[/COLOR]"
msgstr "Aktiverer mørkfarvning af baggrunden i alle områder.[CR][COLOR=white]Mulige mørkfarvningsniveauer: SLUKKET, LET, MEDIUM, TUNG.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301175"
msgid "Choose an accent colour that shows up in many areas of the skin.[CR][COLOR=grey]Custom: Colour codes must be specified in AARRGGBB hex format.[CR]An example for [/COLOR][COLOR=ffffffff]White:[/COLOR] FFFFFFFF"
msgstr "Vælg en accentfarve, der vises på mange områder af huden.[CR][COLOR=grey]Brugerdefineret: Farvekoder skal angives i AARRGGBB hex-format.[CR]Et eksempel på [/COLOR][COLOR=ffffffffffffff]Hvid[/COLOR]: FFFFFFFFFFFF"

msgctxt "#301176"
msgid "Install the ColorPicker addon from the Kodinerds repository to be able to select colors with one click."
msgstr "Installer ColorPicker-tilfojelsen fra Kodinerds-repositoriet, sa du kan vaelge farver med et klik."

msgctxt "#301177"
msgid "Shows the number and total running time of the entries in the database views."
msgstr "I databasevisninger vises antal og samlet løbetid for poster."

msgctxt "#301178"
msgid "Enables an effect of light along the main menu."
msgstr "Aktiverer en lyseffekt langs hovedmenuen."

msgctxt "#301180"
msgid "Select one of the background themes. It strongly changes the overall impression of the main menu.[CR][COLOR=white]Will be deactivated as soon as \'only one background image\' is active.[/COLOR][COLOR=grey][CR]The theme \'Gambit\' has the advantage that it provides better performance on weaker systems.[CR]This theme was kindly provided by \'G4mbit\' from the KODINERDS forum.[/COLOR]"
msgstr "Vælg et af baggrundstemaerne. Det ændrer kraftigt hovedmenuens helhedsindtryk.[CR][COLOR][COLOR=white]Vil blive deaktiveret så snart \'kun ét baggrundsbillede\' er aktiveret.[/COLOR][COLOR=grey][CR]Temaet \'Gambit\' har den fordel, at det giver bedre ydeevne på svagere systemer.[CR]Dette tema blev venligst stillet til rådighed af \'G4mbit\' fra KODINERDS forum.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301184"
msgid "Places a structure over the background image."
msgstr "Lægger en tekstur over baggrundsbilledet."

msgctxt "#301186"
msgid "The player controls are displayed on the left side under the mainmenu during the playing mode."
msgstr "Viser afspillerkontrollerne under afspilning til venstre, under hovedmenuen."

msgctxt "#301188"
msgid "Shows in the upper left corner of the current weather."
msgstr "Viser det aktuelle vejr i øverste venstre hjørne."

msgctxt "#301190"
msgid "It is possible to disable \'Radio\', which is one of 3 views during the playing mode in full screen."
msgstr "\'Radio\', en af 3 visninger under afspilning på fuld skærm, kan deaktiveres her."

msgctxt "#301192"
msgid "Select between the views Standard, Alternative and Radio.[CR][COLOR=grey]\'Radio\' is always used for online music streams. It is possible to disable it.[/COLOR]"
msgstr "Vælg mellem visningerne Standard, Alternativ og Radio.[CR][COLOR=grey]\'Radio\' bruges altid til online musikstreams. Men kan deaktiveres.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301194"
msgid "Select between the views Standard, Alternative and Radio.[CR][COLOR=white]Information: \'Radio\' was disabled.[/COLOR]"
msgstr "Vælg mellem standard- og alternativ visning.[CR][COLOR=white]Info: Radioen er blevet deaktiveret.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301196"
msgid "Displays basic track information in full screen during music playback in the lower left corner.[CR][COLOR=whithe]Visible when OSD is not visible[/COLOR]."
msgstr "Viser grundlæggende sporoplysninger i fuld skærm under musikafspilning i nederste venstre hjørne.[CR][COLOR=whithe]Synlig, når OSD ikke er synlig.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301198"
msgid "Displays a discreet narrow variation of the screen in \'pause\'."
msgstr "Viser en diskret, smal version af pauseskærmen."

msgctxt "#301200"
msgid "Information like chapter, subtitle, current time bar etc. are not displayed.[CR][COLOR=grey]Studio logos and extra arts are faded out.[/COLOR]"
msgstr "Der vises ingen oplysninger såsom kapitler, undertekster, tidslinjer osv.[CR][COLOR=grey]Studiologos og Extra Arts er også skjult.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301202"
msgid "Show all available movie & series artworks.[CR][COLOR=white]Since Kodi 19 artworks are loaded with the scrapper \'The Movie Database PYTHON\'.[/COLOR][COLOR=grey][CR]\'Artwork Beef\' or a similar addon can still be used.[/COLOR]"
msgstr "Vis alle tilgængelige film- og seriekunstværker.[CR][COLOR][COLOR=white]Da Kodi 19 kunstværker er indlæst med scrapper \'The Movie Database PYTHON\'.[/COLOR][COLOR=grey][CR]\'Artwork Beef\' eller en lignende addon kan dog stadig bruges.[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301204"
msgid "Select the appearance of the CD here if no CDArt is found.[CR][COLOR=white]CDArts must be available in a folder. This is specified in the system settings (Media->Music).[/COLOR]"
msgstr "Vælg cd'ens udseende her, hvis der ikke findes nogen CDArt.[CR][COLOR=white]CDArts skal være klar i en mappe. Du kan angive dette i systemindstillingerne (Medier->Musik).[/COLOR]"

msgctxt "#301210"
msgid "Enables all PVR available artwork.[CR][COLOR=white]\'Skin Helper Service\' is required.[/COLOR]"
msgstr "Aktiverer alle tilgængelige PVR-kunstværker.[CR][COLOR=white]\'Skin Helper Service\' er påkrævet.[/COLOR]"

